Setting an <a href="../ApplicationContext.html" title="interface in org.springframework.context"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is optional: If set, registered
tasks will be activated in the <a href="../event/ContextRefreshedEvent.html" title="class in org.springframework.context.event"><code>ContextRefreshedEvent</code></a> phase;
if not set, it will happen at <a href="../../scheduling/annotation/ScheduledAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()"><code>ScheduledAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.afterSingletonsInstantiated()</code></a> time.

